    "title": "Lincoln's Maxx Abruzzino returns from beating cancer, to beating Philip Barbour",
    "text": "PHILIPPI, W. Va. — Maxx Abruzzino has a poster in his room. It has a simple message: “Don’t let it beat you.”\nIt’s been Abruzzino’s mantra every day since last October, when he was diagnosed with Stage 3 testicular cancer, which has a 72%–73% survival rate according to the American Cancer Society. He underwent surgery, “about three or four months” of chemotherapy and then another surgery six weeks ago.",
